### =====================================================================
### Session 3 demos (tag s3-demos). Send these in order, top to bottom.
### VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman.
### Before class: run section 1 of requests/s3-demos.sql.
### Seed data: 0099826704 is The Firm. Author 3 is John Grisham.
